# ============================================================================
# 03_ Target-cluster markers + ASPC/stroma specificity ratio — v2
# ============================================================================
# Consumes the outputs of scRNA_batch_pipeline.R (v8) and 02_calculate_tau.R (v3).
#
# WHAT CHANGED FROM v1
# --------------------
# v1 re-loaded every raw dataset (10x folders, triplets, dense CSVs, tarballs,
# zips), re-preprocessed with `selection.method = "mvp"`, then searched a
# resolution grid to land near 8 clusters. That produced a THIRD partition,
# different again from the batch pipeline's clusters and from 02_'s pseudobulk,
# so ratios, tau and markers were mutually incomparable.
#
# v2 reads what already exists in each cohort folder:
#     cluster.markers.sig_Unknown.csv   <- written by the batch pipeline (Step 5)
#     <cohort>_pseudobulk.rds           <- written by 02_ (gene x cluster means)
#     seurat_merged.rds                 <- fallback if pseudobulk is absent
#
#   * All raw-file loaders removed (~200 lines): read_10x_folder,
#     read_10x_triplet_files, read_dense_csv_gz_counts,
#     read_gene_cell_exprs_table, read_10x_tarball, read_10x_zip,
#     merge_by_union_genes, prefix_cell_barcodes.
#   * Resolution search removed — the partition is fixed upstream.
#   * FindAllMarkers removed — markers were already computed once.
#   * Paths corrected: /Volumes/Jingjing Chen -> /Volumes/Jingjing_Chen
#   * GSE278936 dropped (not in the 18-cohort set); GSE185344 absent
#     (withdrawn); GSE181294, GSE176031, GSE264573, GSE292074, GSE137829,
#     GSE141445, GSE235036, GSE210358 added for Adeno; all 8 NEPC cohorts added.
#   * Target cluster per cohort is now explicit, as specified.
#
# OUTPUTS (per cohort folder)
#   <cohort>_target_markers_top200.csv    top 200 markers of the target cluster
#   <cohort>_aspc_specific_ratio.csv      gene, ratio, tau, target metadata
#
# OUTPUTS (root folders)
#   ratio_NEPC_all_datasets.csv           <- consumed by 06_
#   ratio_Adeno_all_datasets.csv          <- consumed by 06_
#   target_markers_<group>_pooled.csv     all cohorts' top-200 lists stacked
#   marker_ratio_run_log.csv
#
# RATIO DEFINITION (per gene, unchanged from v1)
#   ratio = mean(expr in target cluster) / max(mean(expr in other clusters))
# on the log-normalised "data" layer, via the pseudobulk matrix from 02_.
# ============================================================================

